# Breaking the Bonds of Fate's 32001 arms the main flow leaves: two level 75 Corsairs at level cap 75, accepted at Prog
# 1 (GMs), each with a Corsair's Testimony, by Talacca Cove's _1l0 (maxPlayers 1: one char per area). Main: the
# testimony traded (requiredItems: its wear count rises; the item kept): the 32000 menu; area 1 (option 49: index 3 <<
# 4 | 1); QULTADA (area 1's) killed: won, 32001 opens in the kill step; battlefieldWin cleared by a GM with 32001 open:
# finished: nothing (still accepted). bob: area 2 (option 50), QULTADA+1 (area 2's) killed: 32001; a full bag: finished:
# battlefieldWin 1091: the cap is 75 (not 70): kept, no message; the Scroll of Instant Warp does not fit (giveItem
# unchecked); completed anyway (Master of Chance).
lists TalaccaCove/_1l0/onTrade TalaccaCove/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=TalaccaCove pos=-98.5,-9.399,-87 job=COR lvl=75
char bob zone=TalaccaCove pos=-98.5,-9.399,-87 job=COR lvl=75
levelcap 75
quest AhtUrhgan.AgainstAllOdds completed
quest AhtUrhgan.BreakingTheBondsOfFate accepted
charvar Quest[6][41]Prog 1
item CorsairsTestimony
bob: levelcap 75
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.AgainstAllOdds completed
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.BreakingTheBondsOfFate accepted
bob: charvar Quest[6][41]Prog 1
bob: item CorsairsTestimony
login
trade _1l0 CorsairsTestimony x1         # Prog 1: the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=49                  # area 1
finish
kill QULTADA                            # won: 32001 opens
localvar battlefieldWin 0               # a GM, 32001 open
finish                                  # battlefieldWin 0: nothing
bob: login
bob: trade _1l0 CorsairsTestimony x1    # Prog 1: the 32000 menu
bob: update 32000 option=50             # area 2
bob: finish
bob: kill QULTADA+1                     # area 2's Qultada: won: 32001 opens
bob: fill-inventory
bob: finish                             # cap 75 kept, no message; no scroll (full); completed
